-- Playbook ve-pricing-points-passport: the Founding Member work finished (Logan, 2026-11-01). Safe to run twice.
insert into public.playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind)
select 've-pricing-points-passport', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $pb$BUILD RECORD, 2026-11-01 (Logan). Founding Members: the rest of the DECISION AND BUILD RECORD's to-do, all live.
a. GIVE POINTS. ve-dashboard give_points and member_card gifts deployed (v15, then v17 from commit 297fd8b, sha256 matched); the member card's Give points on the dashboard. Proven: a non-admin, 0 points, a super admin and a Guide account refused; 7 points to the Logan test account landed on both balances and in the gifts list, then were taken back. Ready for Sean to give John Thomas his points.
b. FIND A MEMBER. ve-dashboard member_search (super admins; name, username or email; an exact email first; Guide and quarantined accounts left out) and Find a member at the top of Recent activity, opening the card. Proven in a browser on vegansexplore.com: johnatbhs found, his card opened with Give points.
c. THE DEADLINE IN THE WORDS. "Founding Membership closes at midnight Eastern on January 1, 2027. Join before then and Founding Member stays on your profile for good." on the Passport Guide (Overview, Get your Passport), the $11 window, /policies#membership, the Guides' facts and the saved answer When can I become a Founding Member?, the nav announcement, the dashboard welcome, the Founding Member and Ambassador invitation emails and follow-ups, /invite, and Depot > Founding Members. Each drops the line by itself after the deadline; the $11 window then reads Passport.
d. FOUNDING MEMBER ON THEIR OWN DASHBOARD. ve-dashboard home returns founding_member; the eyebrow, the plan and the welcome say Founding Member only when it is set, Member and Passport otherwise. Proven: the Logan test account (founding_member true) reads Founding Member.
e. NO COMPS IN THE DEPOT. On us removed from Invites, Founding Members and Ambassadors; ve-invites refuses a comp for founding, ambassador and plain invitations while founding_member.comps is false (proven: a comp:true request saved as comp false). Kept: Nonprofit and Group Partner leads (locked canon), dinner seats and the Community Manager role (Sean's call). AMBASSADOR WITHOUT A COMP (Logan's default, Sean's to change): not a member yet, they say yes, pay the $11 on /invite, and on payment become an Ambassador with the level, profile and points Sean set; a member becomes one at once; Founding Member comes from paying before the deadline, not from the invitation. Proven in a rolled-back transaction: accepted, then paid, then joined as an Ambassador at Level 2 with 500 points and Founding Member set.
OPEN. Dani's recorded line on the Ambassador Guide's Your membership tab still says "on us" (new words and recording need Sean). Whether dinner seats and the Community Manager role stop comping too (Sean). After January 1: nothing to do, the trigger and the words stop by themselves.$pb$, 'text', 'build'
where not exists (select 1 from public.playbook_records where slug = 've-pricing-points-passport' and body like 'BUILD RECORD, 2026-11-01 (Logan). Founding Members: the rest%');
